---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Francois Gerber - About">
  <PageHeader title="Who Am I?" />

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    I am a full-stack software engineer: I take a system from the database to the interface and stay
    on it until it is dependable in production. Over a decade of that has meant .NET and C#
    line-of-business systems, Python data pipelines, TypeScript front ends, and the AWS and Azure
    underneath them.
    <br /><br />
    The first half of my career was industrial and enterprise software: a refinery modernisation that
    replaced a dozen standalone tools with one platform wired to scales, label printers and PLCs, and
    a safety and operational-intelligence suite deployed to twelve mining sites.
    <br /><br />
    Since 2022 I have been a developer on the crawling and processing platform behind Ringier's
    marketplaces data — user-configurable pipelines that scrape, process and distribute market
    intelligence in near real time. Since 2024 I have architected, owned and written Hades/Olympus, the
    LLM-powered crawling system inside Palantir Foundry that identifies, extracts and paginates across
    up to 5,000 company websites a day.
    <br /><br />
    I work wherever the problem is, from schema and service to extractor and interface.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Details</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement title="Location" subtitle="Flic en Flac, Black River, Mauritius" />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Home Language"
      subtitle="English (Strong/Fluent: Reading, Written, Spoken – Business Level)"
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Other Languages"
      subtitle="Afrikaans (Native: Reading, Written, Spoken – Business Level)"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Tertiary: MCSD"
      subtitle="2013 to 2015 at WW.IT-IQ Training & Solutions"
    />

    <TimeLineElement
      title="High School: Matric (Grade 12)"
      subtitle="2008 to 2012 at High School Lydenburg"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Senior .NET Full Stack Developer"
      subtitle="2022 to present · Ringier South Africa"
      desc="Since 2024 I have architected, owned and written Hades/Olympus, the LLM-powered crawling system inside Palantir Foundry — identification, extraction and pagination across up to 5,000 company websites a day, on Foundry Pipelines, Datasets and Workshop applications. Before that, developer on the crawling and processing platform behind Ringier's marketplaces data: user-configurable pipelines that scrape, process and distribute market intelligence in near real time (C#, Python, AWS, Vue, React, Scrapy)."
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title=".NET Full Stack Software Developer"
      subtitle="From 2015 till 2022 at BlueMonday PTY (LTD)"
      desc="While working at Blue Monday, I worked on various business solutions for clients and internal tools and systems. I gained experience in various web technologies including Angular, Ionic, Blazor.NET and backend technologies like ASP.NET Web API, WCF and NodeJS."
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Student Developer"
      subtitle="From 2013 till 2015 at WW.IT-IQ Training & Solutions"
      desc="While studying, I worked on programs assigned to me by my lecturers and other programs I thought businesses/people could or would like to use, as well as projects commissioned by clients."
    />
  </div>

